# Phase 4 — Data Warehouse

## Overview

Phase 4 is the core data-engineering phase of the Private Cloud Data Warehouse project.

The objective of this phase was to transform the S&P 500 historical stock dataset into a validated PostgreSQL data warehouse and deploy it inside the K3s private-cloud environment.

The phase focuses on:

* ETL pipeline development
* Data transformation
* Data-quality validation
* Staging architecture
* Dimensional modeling
* Star-schema design
* Fact and dimension tables
* Data-quality quarantine
* PostgreSQL constraints
* Stored procedures
* Analytical queries
* Kubernetes-based PostgreSQL deployment
* Persistent storage

