# 4.1 Source Dataset

The project uses historical S&P 500 stock-price data.

The original dataset contains:

| Column   | Description         |
| -------- | ------------------- |
| `date`   | Trading date        |
| `open`   | Opening stock price |
| `high`   | Highest price       |
| `low`    | Lowest price        |
| `close`  | Closing stock price |
| `volume` | Trading volume      |
| `Name`   | Stock ticker        |

The original dataset contained:

```text
619,040 records
```

