# 4.2 ETL Pipeline

The ETL pipeline follows:

```text
Extract → Transform → Validate → Load
```

### Extract

The source dataset is read into the ETL pipeline.

### Transform

The source columns are normalized into warehouse-friendly names:

```text
open  → open_price
high  → high_price
low   → low_price
close → close_price
Name  → ticker
```

Additional transformations include:

* Date parsing
* Numeric type conversion
* Ticker normalization
* Whitespace removal
* Uppercase ticker conversion
* Data-type standardization

The resulting structure is:

```text
date
ticker
open_price
high_price
low_price
close_price
volume
```

