# 4.8 Warehouse Star Schema

The warehouse follows a star-schema architecture.

```text
                         dim_date
                            |
                            |
                            v
                   +-------------------+
                   |                   |
                   | fact_stock_prices |
                   |                   |
                   +-------------------+
                            ^
                            |
                            |
                       dim_company
```

The three primary warehouse tables are:

```text
warehouse.dim_date
warehouse.dim_company
warehouse.fact_stock_prices
```

