# 4.15 Warehouse Integrity Verification

After the load, the warehouse was checked for invalid OHLC relationships.

The validation checked:

```text
high_price < low_price
```

```text
open_price < low_price
```

```text
open_price > high_price
```

```text
close_price < low_price
```

```text
close_price > high_price
```

Final result:

```text
invalid_fact_rows = 0
```

This confirms that invalid OHLC records did not enter the warehouse fact table.

