# 4.18 PostgreSQL Deployment on K3s

The completed warehouse is deployed inside the K3s private cloud.

```text
K3s Cluster
     |
     v
datawarehouse namespace
     |
     v
PostgreSQL Deployment
     |
     v
PostgreSQL Pod
     |
     v
PersistentVolumeClaim
```

PostgreSQL configuration:

```text
Database: DataWarehouse
Image: postgres:18
Namespace: datawarehouse
```

The PostgreSQL workload uses a persistent volume claim:

```text
postgres-pvc
```

with:

```text
Storage: 20Gi
StorageClass: local-path
Access Mode: RWO
```

